WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.425
This is a supplied fictional intake exercise. The

00:00:03.471 --> 00:00:06.142
approved charter requires complete intake to reach a

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.567
named human reviewer, missing information to stay visible,

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:12.701
and delivery to wait for approval. The baseline

00:00:12.736 --> 00:00:14.640
creates a draft but treats it as ready

00:00:14.687 --> 00:00:17.798
to deliver without an approval gate. A suggested

00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:20.643
dashboard would count records. It would not repair

00:00:20.689 --> 00:00:23.989
the failed approval criterion. Preserve the baseline and

00:00:24.047 --> 00:00:27.472
mark that criterion unmet. Choose the bounded correction:

00:00:28.064 --> 00:00:31.245
separate complete input from approved output and keep

00:00:31.315 --> 00:00:34.775
delivery blocked while approval is absent. Record the

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:39.535
build, review, and testing steps. These are tabletop

00:00:39.616 --> 00:00:42.716
teaching observations, not a deployed system or your

00:00:42.786 --> 00:00:46.112
own test results. For your project, open the

00:00:46.158 --> 00:00:49.189
original criteria and identify the evidence gap before

00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:50.175
accepting an addition.
